    "keepEnglishTerms": [
     "leap year",
     "29 February",
     "365",
     "366"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Parv is celebrating his birthday with friends. He was born on 29 February 2016.\nYears having 29 February are called leap years. They have one additional day and occur every four years.\nCompare February 2024 and February 2025. 2024 has 29 days and 2025 has 28 days.\nMost years have 365 days. A leap year has 366 days.\nLeap years near 2024 are 2016, 2020, 2024, 2028 and 2032. Find the years before and after 2024.\nWrite the months in which you celebrate your favourite festivals."
    }
   },
